sequenceDiagram
    participant Redis
    participant OldAOF as Old AOF File
    participant TempAOF as Temp AOF File
    participant NewAOF as New AOF File

    Redis->>Redis: Trigger AOF rewrite
    Redis->>Redis: Fork child process

    par Parent Process
        Redis->>OldAOF: Continue writing new commands
        Redis->>Redis: Buffer commands for child
    and Child Process
        Redis->>TempAOF: Generate compact AOF file
    end

    Redis->>Redis: Child completes rewrite
    Redis->>TempAOF: Append buffered commands
    Redis->>NewAOF: Atomically rename temp file